From 797c1c4881f42df14601138027af7652bf52c564 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Patrick Williams <patrick@stwcx.xyz>
Date: Fri, 28 Aug 2026 18:10:06 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] bindings-cxx: add optional c++ bindings using nlohmann

Take the approach of libgpiod (and libgpiod-cxx) to define C++
bindings for the libcper.  These provide more ergonomic functions
for getting an `nlohmann::json` instance instead of using json-c.

Tested: Added test cases for all example conversions to ensure they
match the same IR JSON content as the C-only bindings.

Change-Id: I80565a6331321d967e0c080dd9193dff4e90ed1c
Signed-off-by: Patrick Williams <patrick@stwcx.xyz>
